## Measurement plan
- Re-export "Last 7 days" at day 7, 14 and 28 after each batch goes live (same page filter, same range length). Compare against the baselines above.
- Primary metric: **clicks and CTR on the combined set**, not impressions. Batch 1 target: beat 609 clicks / 0.107% per 7 days.
- Use site-wide CTR (0.23% baseline) as the control. If site-wide CTR moves because the impression surge ends, compare relative change, not raw change.
- Do not edit a page again before its window passes (title/CTR 1-3 weeks, content 2-6 weeks).
- After publishing each page, request indexing in GSC (daily quota; do the highest-impression pages first).

